    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Wraithknight",
    "summary": "During each **Normal move**, **Advance move** or **Fall Back move** this model makes, it can pass through models other than **TITANIC** models, and through terrain sections no taller than 4\". While making such a move:\n\n- It may enter enemy models' **Engagement Range** but may not finish the move in it.\n- It may also pass through terrain sections taller than 4\". If it does, roll a D6 after it moves, and a roll of 1 makes this model **Battle-shocked**.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
        "title": "Warhammer 40,000: The App",
        "appVersion": "2.7.1",
        "dataBuild": 972,
        "releaseDate": "2026-10-02"
      }
    ],
